        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    from datetime import date\n\n    start_date = date(2023, 3, 1)\n    end_date = date(2023, 9, 1)\n    nominal_rate = 0.07\n    principal = 200000\n    days_in_year = 365\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    days_accrued = (end_date - start_date).days\n    accrued_interest = principal * nominal_rate * days_accrued / days_in_year\n    answer = round(accrued_interest, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
